### Create a new session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Bleach RP",
    "setting": "Bleach"
}



### Get a session by ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions/d08cf405-06cc-4055-8bb5-7f79b2d652de


### Update a session by ID
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions/d08cf405-06cc-4055-8bb5-7f79b2d652de
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Updated Bleach RP",
    "setting": "Updated Bleach"
}

### Delete a session by ID
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/sessions/d08cf405-06cc-4055-8bb5-7f79b2d652de

